  ,"privacyPolicyAppBar":"Privacy Policy"
  ,"privacyPolicyTitle":"Rubricator Privacy Policy"
  ,"privacyPolicyLastUpdated":"Last updated: 28.07.2026"
  ,"privacyPolicyMeta":"App: Rubricator (Flutter-based, iOS/Android/Web/Desktop)\nDeveloper / Data Controller: İsmail Yücel Ölmez\nContact: support@rubricator.app"
  ,"privacyPolicySection1Title":"1. Introduction"
  ,"privacyPolicySection1Body1":"Rubricator (\"the app\", \"we\", \"our\") is a mobile/desktop application that offers book discovery, personal reading tracking, book notes/reviews, reading lists, and AI-assisted book features."
  ,"privacyPolicySection1Body2":"This Privacy Policy explains which data is collected when you use Rubricator, how that data is used, with whom and why it is shared, how long it is retained, and your rights over your data. The policy was prepared by reviewing the app’s actual technical architecture (including Supabase, a custom API server, and Google Gemini–based AI features)."
  ,"privacyPolicySection1Body3":"By using the app, you accept the data processing activities described in this policy. If you do not accept the policy, please do not use the app."
  ,"privacyPolicySection2Title":"2. What Data We Collect"
  ,"privacyPolicySection21Title":"2.1 Information You Provide When Creating an Account"
  ,"privacyPolicySection21Body":"Accounts in Rubricator are created with an email address and password (one-tap third-party sign-in — Google/Apple Sign-In — is not used). Data we collect during registration and authentication:"
  ,"privacyPolicySection21Item1":"- Your email address"
  ,"privacyPolicySection21Item2":"- Your password (passwords are not stored on our servers; they are stored securely (hashed) by our authentication provider, Supabase Auth, and are never kept in plain text)"
  ,"privacyPolicySection21Item3":"- Username / display name"
  ,"privacyPolicySection21Item4":"- (If applicable) one-time codes (OTP) created during email verification / password reset"
  ,"privacyPolicySection22Title":"2.2 Profile Information"
  ,"privacyPolicySection22Item1":"- Profile photo (optional; you may upload an image from your gallery; gallery access is requested only when you start an upload)"
  ,"privacyPolicySection22Item2":"- Other information you choose to show on your profile"
  ,"privacyPolicySection23Title":"2.3 Content You Create in the App"
  ,"privacyPolicySection23Body":"The following content you create while using the app is stored and associated with your account:"
  ,"privacyPolicySection23Item1":"- Book reviews and ratings (out-of-10 rating system)"
  ,"privacyPolicySection23Item2":"- Book notes and quotes"
  ,"privacyPolicySection23Item3":"- Reading lists (social lists) you create and books you add to them"
  ,"privacyPolicySection23Item4":"- Favorite books"
  ,"privacyPolicySection23Item5":"- \"Read / reading\" statuses, reading logs, and completed-book records"
  ,"privacyPolicySection23Item6":"- Likes on reviews, lists, and content"
  ,"privacyPolicySection23Item7":"- Habit tracker data — e.g. reading goal/streak records"
  ,"privacyPolicySection23Item8":"- In-app search history (may be kept to improve recommendation quality)"
  ,"privacyPolicySection24Title":"2.4 Data Processed for AI Features"
  ,"privacyPolicySection24Body":"Rubricator offers the following AI-assisted features. Inputs for these features are sent to Google Gemini models (embedding and gemini-2.5-flash):"
  ,"privacyPolicySection24Item1":"- Semantic Book Discovery (Virgil): Natural-language search queries are sent via our own server (FastAPI) to the Google Gemini API."
  ,"privacyPolicySection24Item2":"- Document Chat (PDF/EPUB): Uploaded PDF or EPUB files are temporarily transferred to our server, chunked, vectorized, and sent to Google Gemini. Documents and session data are not stored permanently; they are deleted when the session ends or times out."
  ,"privacyPolicySection24Item3":"- Book Chat / Recommendations (Virgil): Questions and recommendations about books are likewise sent to the AI provider. Anonymous usage counters (e.g. daily request counts) may be kept."
  ,"privacyPolicySection24Note":"Important: Data sent to the AI provider (Google Gemini) is subject to that provider’s own privacy policy and data-processing terms. We advise against uploading documents that contain sensitive personal data to Document Chat."
  ,"privacyPolicySection25Title":"2.5 Book Catalog Data (Third-Party Sources)"
  ,"privacyPolicySection25Body":"Book search, cover images, descriptions, and author information are fetched from the Google Books API via a proxy on our server. This data belongs to books and does not contain personal data about you."
  ,"privacyPolicySection26Title":"2.6 Automatically Collected Technical Data"
  ,"privacyPolicySection26Item1":"- Crash/error reports: We use Sentry to monitor stability. Device/OS info, app version, stack trace, and context are sent; direct identifiers such as name/email are not included by default."
  ,"privacyPolicySection26Item2":"- Connectivity status: Checked only on-device; not sent to our servers."
  ,"privacyPolicySection26Item3":"- Local notification data: Reading reminders are scheduled entirely on your device; not sent to our servers."
  ,"privacyPolicySection27Title":"2.7 Device Permissions"
  ,"privacyPolicySection27Body":"Location, camera, contacts, microphone, and similar permissions are not requested. Permissions that may be requested:"
  ,"privacyPolicySection27Item1":"- Internet access: Communicate with our servers and third-party services"
  ,"privacyPolicySection27Item2":"- Send notifications: Reading reminders and in-app notifications"
  ,"privacyPolicySection27Item3":"- Exact alarm / timer: Show reading reminders at the time you set"
  ,"privacyPolicySection27Item4":"- Gallery / file access: Upload a profile photo; select PDF/EPUB for Document Chat"
  ,"privacyPolicySection3Title":"3. Why We Process Your Data"
  ,"privacyPolicySection3Item1":"- Create your account, verify your identity, and manage your session securely"
  ,"privacyPolicySection3Item2":"- Provide core features such as book discovery, search, favorites, lists, notes, and reviews"
  ,"privacyPolicySection3Item3":"- Run AI-assisted semantic search, book recommendations, and Document Chat"
  ,"privacyPolicySection3Item4":"- Offer personalized book recommendations"
  ,"privacyPolicySection3Item5":"- Send reading reminders and habit-tracker notifications"
  ,"privacyPolicySection3Item6":"- Monitor app performance and detect/fix bugs"
  ,"privacyPolicySection3Item7":"- Prevent abuse and enforce service quotas"
  ,"privacyPolicySection3Item8":"- Comply with legal obligations and protect user safety"
  ,"privacyPolicySection3Body":"Your data is processed on the legal bases of consent (e.g. choosing to use AI features), performance of a contract (providing your account and the service), and legitimate interest (security, bug fixing, service improvement)."
  ,"privacyPolicySection4Title":"4. Where Data Is Stored and Security"
  ,"privacyPolicySection4Body":"Your data is hosted on: Supabase (database, authentication, file storage); our API server (FastAPI — semantic search and Document Chat; document sessions are temporary); Google Gemini API; Sentry (error reports)."
  ,"privacyPolicySection4Item1":"- All communication uses encrypted connections (HTTPS/TLS)"
  ,"privacyPolicySection4Item2":"- Passwords are never stored in plain text"
  ,"privacyPolicySection4Item3":"- Database access is scoped to the account owner via Row Level Security (RLS)"
  ,"privacyPolicySection4Item4":"- Server-side authorization and access control are applied"
  ,"privacyPolicySection4Body2":"No internet-based system can be guaranteed 100% secure; however, we take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your data."
  ,"privacyPolicySection5Title":"5. Data Sharing"
  ,"privacyPolicySection5Body":"We do not sell your personal data. Your data is shared only in the following cases and with the following parties:"
  ,"privacyPolicySection5Item1":"- Supabase: Account, profile, user content — hosting, authentication, file storage"
  ,"privacyPolicySection5Item2":"- Google Gemini: Your search queries, document contents, chat messages — AI features"
  ,"privacyPolicySection5Item3":"- Google Books API: Book search terms — catalog data (does not contain personal data)"
  ,"privacyPolicySection5Item4":"- Sentry: Device/app technical info, error traces — stability monitoring"
  ,"privacyPolicySection5Body2":"Data may also be shared to comply with legal obligations, court orders, or official requests; to protect user/app safety; or in a merger, acquisition, or asset sale (you will be notified in advance)."
  ,"privacyPolicySection6Title":"6. Public Content"
  ,"privacyPolicySection6Body":"Some content may be visible to other users (and in some cases to visitors who are not signed in), by default or according to your preference:"
  ,"privacyPolicySection6Item1":"- Reading lists you share publicly"
  ,"privacyPolicySection6Item2":"- Your book reviews, ratings, notes, and quotes (shown with your username)"
  ,"privacyPolicySection6Item3":"- Likes you give or receive"
  ,"privacyPolicySection6Body2":"Even if you delete public content, it may already have been viewed, copied, or shared by others; we have no control over such secondary sharing."
  ,"privacyPolicySection7Title":"7. Data Retention Periods"
  ,"privacyPolicySection7Item1":"- Account and content data are retained while your account is active."
  ,"privacyPolicySection7Item2":"- Document Chat files and session data are automatically deleted when processing/session ends; not stored permanently."
  ,"privacyPolicySection7Item3":"- After an account deletion request is verified, data is deleted within 7 days; some data may be retained up to 30 more days for legal obligations."
  ,"privacyPolicySection7Item4":"- Crash/error reports are subject to Sentry’s retention policy."
  ,"privacyPolicySection8Title":"8. Your Rights"
  ,"privacyPolicySection8Body":"Under KVKK and/or GDPR, to the extent applicable, you have the right to:"
  ,"privacyPolicySection8Item1":"- Learn whether your personal data is being processed"
  ,"privacyPolicySection8Item2":"- Request information about your processed data"
  ,"privacyPolicySection8Item3":"- Access your data and obtain a copy (in a portable format)"
  ,"privacyPolicySection8Item4":"- Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data"
  ,"privacyPolicySection8Item5":"- Request deletion or destruction of your data"
  ,"privacyPolicySection8Item6":"- Object to processing or withdraw consent"
  ,"privacyPolicySection8Item7":"- Object to adverse outcomes produced solely by automated systems"
  ,"privacyPolicySection8Item8":"- Seek redress if you suffer damage due to unlawful processing"
  ,"privacyPolicySection8Body2":"To exercise these rights, contact us at support@rubricator.app."
  ,"privacyPolicySection9Title":"9. Account and Data Deletion"
  ,"privacyPolicySection9Body1":"To delete your account and associated data:"
  ,"privacyPolicySection9Item1":"1. Email support@rubricator.app."
  ,"privacyPolicySection9Item2":"2. Use the subject line \"Account Deletion Request\"."
  ,"privacyPolicySection9Item3":"3. Include the email address registered with Rubricator in the message body."
  ,"privacyPolicySection9Body2":"After your request is verified, your account profile and personal data are deleted within 7 days; limited data required for legal retention may be kept for up to 30 additional days."
  ,"privacyPolicySection10Title":"10. Children’s Privacy"
  ,"privacyPolicySection10Body":"Rubricator is not directed at children under 13 and does not knowingly collect data from that age group. If we learn that a child under 13 has provided us personal data, we will delete it within a reasonable time. If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child has provided us data, please contact us at support@rubricator.app."
  ,"privacyPolicySection11Title":"11. Local Storage (Data Stored on Device)"
  ,"privacyPolicySection11Body":"The app stores some preferences and cache data (e.g. session info, theme preference, temporary content cache) locally on your device. This data is removed when you uninstall the app and is not automatically sent to our servers."
  ,"privacyPolicySection12Title":"12. International Data Transfers"
  ,"privacyPolicySection12Body":"Our infrastructure providers (Supabase, Google, Sentry) may process your data on servers outside Türkiye (e.g. the European Union or the United States). For such transfers, we rely on the security and compliance mechanisms offered by those providers (standard contractual clauses, data processing agreements, etc.)."
  ,"privacyPolicySection13Title":"13. Third-Party Services and Links"
  ,"privacyPolicySection13Body":"The app may contain links to third-party websites or resources. Those third-party sites have their own privacy policies; this policy covers only Rubricator’s own data processing."
  ,"privacyPolicySection13Item1":"- Supabase Privacy Policy: https://supabase.com/privacy"
  ,"privacyPolicySection13Item2":"- Google Privacy Policy: https://policies.google.com/privacy (Gemini API and Google Books API)"
  ,"privacyPolicySection13Item3":"- Sentry Privacy Policy: https://sentry.io/privacy/"
  ,"privacyPolicySection14Title":"14. Changes to This Policy"
  ,"privacyPolicySection14Body":"We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. For material changes, we may notify you via an in-app notice or email. The current policy is always published with the \"Last updated\" date at the top of this page. We recommend reviewing the policy regularly."
  ,"privacyPolicySection15Title":"15. Contact"
  ,"privacyPolicySection15Body":"For questions, requests, or complaints about this Privacy Policy or the processing of your personal data:"
  ,"privacyPolicySection15Contact":"Rubricator\nEmail: support@rubricator.app\nDeveloper: İsmail Yücel Ölmez"
  ,"privacyPolicyFooter":"By using Rubricator, you agree to this Privacy Policy."
}
